nverters on Jul 28, then the replacements are caught too: Coherent manufactures in China, and Lumentum's North American assembly is ramping in THAILAND, as is Fabrinet's entire model. The only listed capacity that clears an origin test outright is AAOI's Sugar Land and Pearland build-out, live from summer 2026 \u2014 and Cignal judges AAOI too small to fill the gap. Both branches therefore end in shortage and cost inflation for the hyperscalers rather than clean substitution. Second-guessing the scope is the highest-value work on this lever; the beneficiary list is worthless until it resolves.","hits":"opt, net"},{"d":"2027-01-14","type":"earnings","tk":"TSM","n":"TSMC","conv":3,"froth":1,"eps":5.16,"eps_lo":5.1,"eps_hi":5.28,"dd":-13.9,"ts":1799929800,"when":"pre","xt":"07:30 EST"}]}